      en: ["Total length: 34 km", "Pioneered bamboo rafting", "Located near Port Antonio", "Stunning canyon scenery"],
      es: ["Longitud: 34 km", "Balsas de bambú", "En Port Antonio", "Naturaleza espectacular"],
      pt: ["Comprimento: 34 km", "Jangadas de bambu", "Em Port Antonio", "Natureza espetacular"],
      fr: ["Longueur : 34 km", "Radeaux de bambou", "À Port Antonio", "Nature spectaculaire"],
